<title>SWEDEN: TENNIS-FRANCE WIN DAVIS CUP FINAL.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-FRANCE WIN DAVIS CUP FINAL.</headline>
<dateline>MALMO, Sweden 1996-12-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>France won the Davis Cup on Sunday when they beat Sweden 3-2 in the final after a five-set victory in the deciding match by Arnaud Boetsch over Nicklas Kulti.</p>
</text>
